{"4061790": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Skye's Repose", "steam_appid": 4061790, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061790/extras/32ef83e50ebc2520152f3b4a2f9de649.avif?t=1787933530\" width=1560 height=504 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Welcome to the Garden of Skye</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You awaken in a strange new world with no memory of who you are.  Discover the secrets of the Garden of Skye, a mysterious realm of islands in the clouds covered in ruins of the past.  Taking inspiration from <i>Stardew Valley </i>and <i>Myst</i>, this game revolves around exploration, puzzle solving, and making connections with the mages who are lonely and hurting at home.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Current Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two mages to befriend</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four unique areas to explore</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Numerous upgrades to unlock</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tons of unique crops to farm</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A myriad  of elemental combinations to discover</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Countless puzzles and riddles to discover</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lots of synonyms for Many</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is still in Early Access, so at present only two of six mages and three of nine areas are accessible to explore, with more coming as development continues.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061790/extras/7241daf7e00b3b720db29bd56f216235.webp?t=1787933530\" width=500 height=28 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Befriend</strong></u> the Mages who found a way home long ago, and get their help finding your own way through this confusing world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But friendship isn't always easy.  Everyone has <u>s</u>truggles and needs help sometimes.  But what can you do while you're stuck a world away...?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061790/extras/b2132971c8ddc8962242db7e6e6fda6e.avif?t=1787933530\" width=400 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061790/extras/7241daf7e00b3b720db29bd56f216235.webp?t=1787933530\" width=500 height=28 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Explore</u></strong> the quiet Garden forgotten by time.  Discover the stories left be<u>h</u>ind in each unique environment, and gather the strange new materials each land provides.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rainbow deserts, a darkened forest, an empty city, volcanic caves; there's lots to find in the Garden.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061790/extras/e32457b51aa01f3ec1af7d82e85fde20.poster.avif?t=1787933530\" width=1170 height=652 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061790/extras/e32457b51aa01f3ec1af7d82e85fde20.webm?t=1787933530\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061790/extras/e32457b51aa01f3ec1af7d82e85fde20.mp4?t=1787933530\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061790/extras/7241daf7e00b3b720db29bd56f216235.webp?t=1787933530\" width=500 height=28 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Repair</strong></u> the ru<u>i</u>n of the Garden of Skye, and fix the structures left by the Mages mere years ago in your quest to find a way out of this realm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, every step of progress leaves a visible mark, letting you see the impact you're making in this world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061790/extras/bd3c9f50716ef0a00b397cdbd4de6f6d.poster.avif?t=1787933530\" width=1170 height=550 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061790/extras/bd3c9f50716ef0a00b397cdbd4de6f6d.webm?t=1787933530\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061790/extras/bd3c9f50716ef0a00b397cdbd4de6f6d.mp4?t=1787933530\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061790/extras/7241daf7e00b3b720db29bd56f216235.webp?t=1787933530\" width=500 height=28 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Farm</strong></u> with the help of elemental magic!  Water large swaths of land, bur<u>n</u> away misplaced crops, or infuse life into slower crops!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each area has multiple unique mystical plants to farm, and later you'll discover other ways to create and farm new seeds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061790/extras/0337017dbeef7d83544d336edab02af3.poster.avif?t=1787933530\" width=1170 height=622 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061790/extras/0337017dbeef7d83544d336edab02af3.webm?t=1787933530\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061790/extras/0337017dbeef7d83544d336edab02af3.mp4?t=1787933530\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061790/extras/7241daf7e00b3b720db29bd56f216235.webp?t=1787933530\" width=500 height=28 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Combine</strong></u> elementals into new and unique aspects, and use them to farm or charge ancient mechanisms.  Or store them in the elemental pools scattered around the Garden.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elementals serve double duty, <u>a</u>cting as a currency when stored in the elemental pools, and acting as a catalyst for a variety of effects around the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061790/extras/f6f9ccd6aa72c905ce8dc675409e9522.poster.avif?t=1787933530\" width=1170 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061790/extras/f6f9ccd6aa72c905ce8dc675409e9522.webm?t=1787933530\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061790/extras/f6f9ccd6aa72c905ce8dc675409e9522.mp4?t=1787933530\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061790/extras/7241daf7e00b3b720db29bd56f216235.webp?t=1787933530\" width=500 height=28 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's always another sec<u>r</u>et to uncover within the Garden of Skye.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open the Gate, and bring hope to the lonely and hurting.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061790/extras/32ef83e50ebc2520152f3b4a2f9de649.avif?t=1787933530\" width=1560 height=504 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Welcome to the Garden of Skye</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You awaken in a strange new world with no memory of who you are.  Discover the secrets of the Garden of Skye, a mysterious realm of islands in the clouds covered in ruins of the past.  Taking inspiration from <i>Stardew Valley </i>and <i>Myst</i>, this game revolves around exploration, puzzle solving, and making connections with the mages who are lonely and hurting at home.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Current Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two mages to befriend</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four unique areas to explore</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Numerous upgrades to unlock</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tons of unique crops to farm</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A myriad  of elemental combinations to discover</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Countless puzzles and riddles to discover</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lots of synonyms for Many</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is still in Early Access, so at present only two of six mages and three of nine areas are accessible to explore, with more coming as development continues.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061790/extras/7241daf7e00b3b720db29bd56f216235.webp?t=1787933530\" width=500 height=28 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Befriend</strong></u> the Mages who found a way home long ago, and get their help finding your own way through this confusing world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But friendship isn't always easy.  Everyone has <u>s</u>truggles and needs help sometimes.  But what can you do while you're stuck a world away...?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061790/extras/b2132971c8ddc8962242db7e6e6fda6e.avif?t=1787933530\" width=400 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061790/extras/7241daf7e00b3b720db29bd56f216235.webp?t=1787933530\" width=500 height=28 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Explore</u></strong> the quiet Garden forgotten by time.  Discover the stories left be<u>h</u>ind in each unique environment, and gather the strange new materials each land provides.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rainbow deserts, a darkened forest, an empty city, volcanic caves; there's lots to find in the Garden.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061790/extras/e32457b51aa01f3ec1af7d82e85fde20.poster.avif?t=1787933530\" width=1170 height=652 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061790/extras/e32457b51aa01f3ec1af7d82e85fde20.webm?t=1787933530\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><s