l plants to farm, and later you'll discover other ways to create and farm new seeds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061790/extras/0337017dbeef7d83544d336edab02af3.poster.avif?t=1787933530\" width=1170 height=622 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061790/extras/0337017dbeef7d83544d336edab02af3.webm?t=1787933530\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061790/extras/0337017dbeef7d83544d336edab02af3.mp4?t=1787933530\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061790/extras/7241daf7e00b3b720db29bd56f216235.webp?t=1787933530\" width=500 height=28 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Combine</strong></u> elementals into new and unique aspects, and use them to farm or charge ancient mechanisms.  Or store them in the elemental pools scattered around the Garden.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elementals serve double duty, <u>a</u>cting as a currency when stored in the elemental pools, and acting as a catalyst for a variety of effects around the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061790/extras/f6f9ccd6aa72c905ce8dc675409e9522.poster.avif?t=1787933530\" width=1170 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061790/extras/f6f9ccd6aa72c905ce8dc675409e9522.webm?t=1787933530\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061790/extras/f6f9ccd